{
  "about": "Contracts, generated at random in the garage (src/game/missions.js). Each has one goal from `goals` with targets drawn from its ranges and sized to the trail being played and to the trucks owned, may be locked to a class or to one owned truck (`locks`), and may carry 0 to 2 `twists` (extra rules). XP is `baseXp` times the goal's difficulty plus each twist's `xp` and the lock's, rounded to 50; class-locked contracts also scale by the class (XP_BY_CLASS). One offer is always a depot contract for the class driven least. Offers not chosen are redrawn after every run; the chosen one stays until done. Failing costs nothing.",
  "offerCount": 4,
  "baseXp": 500,
